\":96,\"prompt\":\"画面：两人抬脚赤脚踩进浅浪，细碎白浪花漫过脚背，裙摆被海风和浪花微微扬起，两人慢悠悠踏水小步前行，时不时看向彼此浅笑，落日霞光铺满整片海面。\\n对白（女生轻笑）：“那我们说好啦，不许反悔。”\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"048783c6a3c6eb1747ce0f7e739442a4887153482cd5888e13a24a6c94c586ea.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=048783c6a3c6eb1747ce0f7e739442a4887153482cd5888e13a24a6c94c586ea.png&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIwMDYyZDYzZTU2YjYxMTJjMWNmZGQ0NTNkNzJlMjcyZiIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODExNTczNzg5MDYsInRzIjoxNzgwNTUyNTc4OTA2LCJzaWduIjoiZDJmMTM1YTQwZTRjNmQzNGEwMTZlMTU0ZjliNjRiMzkifQ==&Rh-Identify=0062d63e56b6112c1cfdd453d72e272f\"},{\"id\":\"1780552720569aghtu\",\"start\":386,\"length\":94,\"prompt\":\"画面：镜头推进近景，女生侧身回头看向镜头（男生在画面左侧虚化背影），眉眼温柔笑容明媚，落日逆光勾勒发丝轮廓，海面波光在身后缓缓晃动，画面慢慢定格。\\n对白（男生宠溺）：“一言为定。”\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"e3490bc5d0244440a2fea115527361f0e053b2a708c4e076acf3b2b476d0ec5b.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=e3490bc5d0244440a2fea115527361f0e053b2a708c4e076acf3b2b476d0ec5b.png&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIwMDYyZDYzZTU2YjYxMTJjMWNmZGQ0NTNkNzJlMjcyZiIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODExNTczNzg5MDYsInRzIjoxNzgwNTUyNTc4OTA2LCJzaWduIjoiZDJmMTM1YTQwZTRjNmQzNGEwMTZlMTU0ZjliNjRiMzkifQ==&Rh-Identify=0062d63e56b6112c1cfdd453d72e272f\"}],\"audioSegments\":[]}",
